  m_text: '<style=h1>The Rocket Room</style>

    Scroll to see different parts of
    the ship.


    Use the <color=#53b2a6>sidebar menus</color> to build sections
    of the rocket.  Building the <color=#53b2a6>most recommended</color> parts yields
    the best results!


    While a part is being built, click on popups to solve
    issues that <color=#53b2a6>slow down construction</color>.

'
